  {"id":"en_g_a_01","section":"grammar","level":"advanced","question":"Had I known earlier, I ___ differently.","options":["would act","would have acted","will act","acted"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Third Conditional (inversiya bilan): had + V3, would have + V3."},
  {"id":"en_g_a_02","section":"grammar","level":"advanced","question":"Not only ___ late, but he also forgot the documents.","options":["he was","was he","he is","is he"],"correct":1,"explanation":"'Not only' bilan boshlanganda inversiya bo'ladi: was he."},
  {"id":"en_g_a_03","section":"grammar","level":"advanced","question":"By next year, she ___ here for a decade.","options":["will work","will have worked","works","worked"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Future Perfect: will have + V3 — kelajakda tugallangan harakat."},
  {"id":"en_g_a_04","section":"grammar","level":"advanced","question":"I wish I ___ more time yesterday.","options":["have","had","had had","would have"],"correct":2,"explanation":"O'tgan zamon haqida afsuslanish: wish + Past Perfect (had had)."},

